{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "AsRPG Collection - Sales, Science & Spirits",
    "steam_appid": 3614300,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614300/extras/4ff3df3e6c3cda74504de90bb4646abd.avif?t=1753844495\" width=544 height=32 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A</strong>lieno's <strong>R</strong>evitalized <strong>P</strong>layable <strong>G</strong>rime <strong>Collection</strong>, a tale of <strong>Sales</strong>, <strong>Science</strong> and <strong>Spirits</strong>...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soon, you will be able to experience three classic RPGMAKER2003 games in new and improved forms! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The games are: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Norman Jones Selling Extravaganza [Employee Of The Month Edition] </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Professor Frippel's Special Invention Show - PEER REVIEWED </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Miodesopsia </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These games come featuring huge improvements in collaboration with PsychoAlpaca, co-creator of Norman Jones, and Michael, programmer and creator of the Zero Point Games Studio and Zero Point Survivor. Featuring music by Pixeltherapy, Viridian Wright and Michael! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will see tons of new areas, obstacles, characters and enemies, as well as an incredibly thorough process of polishing and bugfixing. The three games will be packaged into one launcher, with tons of extra stuff!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Also experience the endless runner minigame &quot;Imprisoned For Time&quot;, and tons of extras in the featured playable launcher!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-----</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NOTE: These are not ARPGs...it's A.R.P.G.!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>H</strong>ow <strong>I</strong>t <strong>W</strong>orks</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upon starting this game, you will open up the Launcher, an <i>interactable</i> world set in some public toilets where the Assistant Director has done some business.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click on the three doors to access three different RPGs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drag and drop characters around! Try shaking the window too!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click on the clock on the wall to access &quot;Imprisoned For Time&quot;, an endless runner minigame.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click on the Rubbish Bin to access Extras (like concept art).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-----</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>W</strong>hat <strong>Y</strong>ou <strong>G</strong>et</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Norman Jones</strong> is a salesman sent to a remote, rural village, where he is tasked with selling vacuum cleaners to earn a promotion from The Boss!<br>&quot;Fight&quot; for that sweet deal,\u00a0 explore the land and unravel the mysteries underpinning the company...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Professor Frippel</strong> is a scientist with a new invention to showcase! When it backfires, all scientists in town are turned into mice and end up on a strange alien planet! <br> Battle your way through 3 areas (or dungeons) and collect parts to fix their ship! What revelations await them?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Miodesopsia</strong> is an experimental game about the protagonist's last few minutes of life following an accident in the bathtub. Following judgement carried out by a being that calls herself &quot;The Archon&quot;, a brief intermission leads to exploring a dreamlike afterlife.<br>Collect souls, and pave your own path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Imprisoned For Time </strong>follows Timothy T. Timesworth, a chronologist who dared mess with the order of TIME and was rightfully punished for his transgression.  <br>Run endlessly and get that high score!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614300/extras/51337308d1057e6e25bb95b5a738ff1d.avif?t=1753844495\" width=544 height=32 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614300/extras/4ff3df3e6c3cda74504de90bb4646abd.avif?t=1753844495\" width=544 height=32 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A</strong>lieno's <strong>R</strong>evitalized <strong>P</strong>layable <strong>G</strong>rime <strong>Collection</strong>, a tale of <strong>Sales</strong>, <strong>Science</strong> and <strong>Spirits</strong>...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soon, you will be able to experience three classic RPGMAKER2003 games in new and improved forms! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The games are: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Norman Jones Selling Extravaganza [Employee Of The Month Edition] </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Professor Frippel's Special Invention Show - PEER REVIEWED </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Miodesopsia </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These games come featuring huge improvements in collaboration with PsychoAlpaca, co-creator of Norman Jones, and Michael, programmer and creator of the Zero Point Games Studio and Zero Point Survivor. Featuring music by Pixeltherapy, Viridian Wright and Michael! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will see tons of new areas, obstacles, characters and enemies, as well as an incredibly thorough process of polishing and bugfixing. The three games will be packaged into one launcher, with tons of extra stuff!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Also experience the endless runner minigame &quot;Imprisoned For Time&quot;, and tons of extras in the featured playable launcher!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-----</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NOTE: These are not ARPGs...it's A.R.P.G.!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>H</strong>ow <strong>I</strong>t <strong>W</strong>orks</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upon starting this game, you will open up the Launcher, an <i>interactable</i> world set in some public toilets where the Assistant Director has done some business.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click on the three doors to access three different RPGs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drag and drop characters around! Try shaking the window too!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click on the clock on the wall to access &quot;Imprisoned For Time&quot;, an endless runner minigame.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click on the Rubbish Bin to access Extras (like concept art).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-----</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>W</strong>hat <strong>Y</strong>ou <strong>G</strong>et</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Norman Jones</strong> is a salesman sent to a remote, rural village, where he is tasked with selling vacuum cleaners to earn a promotion from The Boss!<br>&quot;Fight&quot; for that sweet deal,\u00a0 explore the land and unravel the mysteries underpinning the company...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Professor Frippel</strong> is a scientist with a new invention to showcase! When it backfires, all scientists in town are turned into mice and end up on a strange alien planet! <br> Battle your way through 3 areas (or dungeons) and collect parts to fix their ship! What revelations await them?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Miodesopsia</strong> is an experimental game about the protagonist's last few minutes of life following an accident in the bathtub. Following judgement carried out by a being that calls herself &quot;The Archon&quot;, a brief intermission leads to exploring a dreamlike afterlife.<br>Collect souls, and pave your own path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Imprisoned For Time </strong>follows Timothy T. Timesworth, a chronologist who dared mess with the order of TIME and was rightfully punished for his transgression.  <br>Run endlessly and get that high score!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614300/extras/51337308d1057e6e25bb95b5a738ff1d.avif?t=1753844495\" width=544 height=32 /></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Play 3 RPG Maker 2003 games remastered and upgraded for 2025 - &quot;Norman Jones' Selling Extravaganza&quot;, &quot;Professor Frippel's Special Invention Show&quot; and &quot;Miodesopsia&quot;. Comes packaged into an exclusive interactive launcher with an extras folder and a runner minigame: &quot;Imprisoned For Time&quot;!",
